&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Sony Interactive Entertainment?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment isn’t just the Best Place to Play — it’s also the Best Place to Work. Sony Interactive Entertainment (SIE) is the company behind the PlayStation brand. As a subsidiary of Sony Group Corporation, we’re part of a proud legacy of innovation and excellence. SIE is a dynamic technology company, delivering cutting-edge hardware and network services to more than 100 million people and an entertainment leader, home to some of the most beloved and recognizable intellectual properties (IP) in the world. Our role at SIE is to create and nurture the experiences under the PlayStation brand, a name synonymous with entertainment excellence and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #4a4a4a;&quot;&gt;Technical Program Manager - 12 month contract&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #4a4a4a;&quot;&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment is seeking a Technical Program Manager to lead complex technical initiatives that span multiple functionality within the quality engineering division. PlayStation&#39;s Software Quality Engineering teams align across PlayStation ensuring that the PlayStation brand retains its association with quality, detail, and exceptional experiences. Tasked with ensuring an extremely high level of quality in everything we ship, the QE teams work alongside developers, designs, and product owners to ensure test coverage of all feature areas and develop new and innovative test strategies and technologies for automation and manual testing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #4a4a4a;&quot;&gt;The Technical Program Manager leads complex technical initiatives that span multiple functionality within the quality engineering division. To excel in this role, you must be able to navigate ambiguous technical challenges, work well within set deadlines, and drive through influence. In this role, you will lead a diverse team through the processes of establishing online services linking to multiple platforms and apps.&amp;nbsp; Ideal candidates have knowledge of cloud services, work independently and seek to define order from complex multi-project needs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #4a4a4a;&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #4a4a4a !important;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #4a4a4a;&quot;&gt;Own delivery of large scale technical programs with significant impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #4a4a4a !important;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #4a4a4a;&quot;&gt;Define deliverables and milestones for cross team dependencies to achieve maximum efficiency.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #4a4a4a !important;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #4a4a4a;&quot;&gt;Develop a comprehensive roadmap for future releases and projects ensuring teams are able to allocate resources to achieve the roadmap with minimal risks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #4a4a4a !important;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #4a4a4a;&quot;&gt;Identify and mitigate risks across multiple programs providing clear and proactive communication to Program Management leadership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #4a4a4a !important;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #4a4a4a;&quot;&gt;Drive alignment across stakeholders providing clear communication and alignment to define key internal milestones, lead technical trade-offs, execute retrospective processes, and optimize program management processes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #4a4a4a !important;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #4a4a4a;&quot;&gt;Backup program team for additional programs including internal tooling.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #4a4a4a !important;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #4a4a4a;&quot;&gt;Develop and maintain deep understanding of systems including HW and SW architecture as well as Application or HW integrations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #4a4a4a !important;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #4a4a4a;&quot;&gt;Keep aligned with current technical trends and emerging technologies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #4a4a4a;&quot;&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #4a4a4a !important;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #4a4a4a;&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s Degree in Engineering, Computer Science, related field or equivalent experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #4a4a4a !important;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #4a4a4a;&quot;&gt;3+ years of technical program management experience in software development; Network and HW experience a plus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #4a4a4a !important;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #4a4a4a;&quot;&gt;Proven track record of delivering on schedule across complex, multi-team technical programs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #4a4a4a !important;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #4a4a4a;&quot;&gt;Technical experience with reviewing software architecture and design.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #4a4a4a !important;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #4a4a4a;&quot;&gt;Technical experience in online services. Experience integrating with personal devices, apps on PC, or consoles, a plus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #4a4a4a !important;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #4a4a4a;&quot;&gt;Deep understanding of quality engineering including shift left/shift right methodologies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #4a4a4a !important;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #4a4a4a;&quot;&gt;Experience with program management and issue tracking tools such as Asana and JIRA.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #4a4a4a !important;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #4a4a4a;&quot;&gt;Experience with KPI development and management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #4a4a4a !important;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #4a4a4a;&quot;&gt;Proven ability to quickly learn new software.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At SIE, working with our partners, we consider several factors when setting each role’s base pay range, including the competitive benchmarking data for the market and geographic location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Please note that the individual base pay range may vary based on job-related factors which may include knowledge, skills, experience, and location.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In addition, this role is eligible for benefit offerings that include medical, dental, and vision. Click &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dzconnex.com/summary-of-benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to learn more.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The estimated base pay range for this role is listed below, this is an hourly rate.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$70&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$90 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please note, Sony Interactive Entertainment conducts background checks at the offer stage for all new employees (which may include criminal background checks for some roles) and will need to process personal information to support these checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please refer to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.playstation.com/legal/careers-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information about what personal information we collect, how we use it, who we share it with, and your data protection rights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All persons will receive consideration for employment without regard to gender (including gender identity, gender expression and gender reassignment), race (including colour, nationality, ethnic or national origin), religion or belief, marital or civil partnership status, disability, age, sexual orientation, pregnancy, maternity or parental status, trade union membership or membership in any other legally protected category.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We strive to create an inclusive environment, empower employees and embrace diversity. We encourage everyone to respond.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment is a Fair Chance employer and qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records will be considered for employment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
